<h1 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-ObjectIntelligence=
Engine"><strong>Object Intelligence Engine</strong></h1>
<h2 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-Domain-AgnosticObj=
ectRecognition">Domain-Agnostic Object Recognition</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-SystemOverview">Sy=
stem Overview</h3>
<p>This is a universal object training system that works for any object typ=
e - from industrial equipment to retail products, medical devices, agricult=
ural machinery, to guitars. The system learns from examples without requiri=
ng model retraining.</p>
<p>The complete flow</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Initial Detection</strong>: Frame contains unknown vacuum =E2=86=
=92 Florence-2 says "vacuum cleaner" =E2=86=92 DINOv3 creates embedding</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Human Labels</strong>: User labels it as "Shark Vertex AZ2002" =
=E2=86=92 System stores embedding as template</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Future Recognition</strong>: New frame =E2=86=92 DINOv3 embeddin=
g =E2=86=92 Compare to all templates =E2=86=92 Similarity &gt; threshold =
=E2=86=92 Identified as "Shark Vertex AZ2002"</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Continuous Improvement</strong>: More examples =E2=86=92 Update =
centroid =E2=86=92 Adjust threshold =E2=86=92 Better recognition</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-BasicUserJourney">=
Basic User Journey</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>When we label a vacuum as "Shark Vertex AZ2002"</strong>, the sy=
stem stores the DINOv3 embedding (768-dimensional vector) of that vacuum as=
 a template.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>In future frames</strong>, every detected vacuum gets its own DI=
NOv3 embedding extracted.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Recognition happens via cosine similarity</strong>: The new embe=
dding is compared to all stored templates. If similarity &gt; threshold (ty=
pically 0.75-0.90), it's identified as that specific product.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-TheRecognitionFunc=
tion:">The Recognition Function:</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># For e=
ach detected object in a frame:
object_embedding =3D dinov3_model.extract_features(object_crop)

# Compare to ALL customer templates
for template in customer_templates:
    similarity =3D cosine_similarity(object_embedding, template["centroid"]=
)
    if similarity &gt; template["threshold"]:
        # This IS a Shark Vertex AZ2002!</pre>
</div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p>DINOv3 embeddings of the same object (even from different angles) have h=
igh similarity (typically 0.8-0.95)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Different objects have lower similarity (typically 0.3-0.7)</p></li>
<li>
<p>The threshold is dynamically adjusted based on variance in training samp=
les</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-Advantages:">Advan=
tages:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>No model retraining needed</strong> - just store and compare emb=
eddings</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Works with 1 sample</strong> but improves with more (5-20 ideal)=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Real-time recognition</strong> - just vector comparison</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Customer isolation</strong> - SharkNinja's templates don't affec=
t other customers</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-PracticalConsidera=
tions:">Practical Considerations:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Store templates in memory for fast matching (loading once per session)</=
p></li>
<li>
<p>Use centroids (average of multiple embeddings) for robust matching</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Implement feedback loops to continuously improve templates</p></li>
<li>
<p>Queue low-confidence matches for human review</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-DesignOverview">De=
sign Overview</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-TheTemplateManager=
"><strong>The Template Manager</strong></h3>
<p>This component is the "write path" of the system and is responsible for =
the lifecycle of object templates. It combines the logic from the <code>Gen=
ericTemplateManager</code> and <code>HierarchicalObjectClassifier</code>. W=
hen a human labels an unknown object (e.g., providing "Shark Vertex AZ2002"=
 for a "vacuum cleaner"), the Template Manager:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Receives the new label and the associated embeddings of the example imag=
es.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Checks if a template for this object already exists.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If it's a new object, it creates a new record, calculates the initial ce=
ntroid and similarity threshold, and inserts it into the <code>object_templ=
ates</code> collection in Milvus.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If the object already exists, it updates the template by recalculating t=
he centroid with the new example embedding and adjusting the similarity thr=
eshold based on the increased sample variance.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-TheRecognitionEngi=
ne"><strong>The Recognition Engine</strong></h3>
<p>This is the real-time "read path" of the system. It's a high-throughput =
service that takes an unknown object detected by Metasight and attempts to =
identify it. For each detected object, the Recognition Engine:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Receives the object's DINOv3 embedding and its base_class from Florence-=
2.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Constructs an efficient Milvus query. It first filters by customer_id an=
d the base_class to dramatically narrow the search space.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Performs a vector similarity search on the remaining templates using the=
 object's embedding.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If the top match's similarity score is greater than that template's spec=
ific <code>similarity_threshold</code>, it returns a positive identificatio=
n.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-TheUnidentifiedObj=
ectQueue"><strong>The Unidentified Object Queue</strong></h3>
<p>This component closes the continuous improvement loop. If the Recognitio=
n Engine cannot find a match for an object that exceeds the required thresh=
old, it forwards the object's data (embedding, base_class, source video ref=
erence) to a dedicated queue. This queue feeds a labeling interface where a=
 human operator can review the unknown objects and submit them to the Templ=
ate Manager for training, making the system smarter over time.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"f3=
4317cb-3f15-4e96-9073-ccc2d9c6027a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>System Component</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Reads From...</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Writes To...</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Purpose</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Detection Workflow</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>frame_archive</code>, <code>object_detections</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Logs all raw visual evidence and general descriptions.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Recognition Engine</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>object_detections</code>, <code>object_templates</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Cross-references new evidence against known identities to find a match.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Training System (Human-in-the-loop)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>(Labeling Queue)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>object_templates</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Creates new "known identity" records based on human feedback.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-DatabaseSchema"><s=
trong>Database Schema</strong></h1>
<p>The Milvus collection is designed for hybrid search, storing both the ve=
ctor for similarity search and the detailed metadata for filtering.</p>
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-VideoFrameArchive"=
><strong>Video Frame Archive</strong></h3>
<p>This collection is the master library, serving as the system's "source o=
f truth" for every video frame that has been analyzed. It is designed for b=
road, scene-level searches and historical review.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"98=
7057bc-7c5e-4d27-add7-9ecf98294701" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Data Type</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dimensions</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Indexing</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Description</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>pk_id</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Int64</code></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Primary Key</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A unique, auto-incrementing primary key for each record.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>image_embedding</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Vector</code></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>(e.g., 1024)</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Vector (HNSW)</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The DINOv3 embedding for powerful visual similarity search.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>source_video</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>VarChar</code></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>(e.g., 256)</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Path or identifier for the source video file. Indexed for filtering.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>timestamp</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Int64</code></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unix epoch timestamp of the frame. Indexed for time-range filtering.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>metadata</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>JSON</code></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8fafd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The complete JSON blob from Florence-2, containing all detected objects,=
 bboxes, and captions.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-ObjectIndex"><stro=
ng>Object Index</strong></h3>
<p>For every individual object identified within a frame, a separate, dedic=
ated record is created here. This enables highly specific, object-centric s=
earches.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"27=
ff7fe8-fcf1-44ea-8246-f967507f2ad9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Data Type</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dimensions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Indexing</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Description</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>detection_id</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>VarChar</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Primary Key</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A unique identifier for each specific object detection.</p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>frame_id</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Int64</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Foreign key linking back to the <code>pk_id</code> in the <code>video_fr=
ames</code> collection.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>object_class</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>VarChar</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>128</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The object's classification (e.g., "person," "vehicle").</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>confidence</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Float</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The detection confidence score from the model (0.0-1.0).</p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>bbox_embedding</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Vector</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>512</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Vector (HNSW)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A DINOv3 embedding of just the object's bounding box crop for specific v=
isual search.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>bbox_coordinates</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>JSON</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>None</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The object's bounding box coordinates, e.g., [x1, y1, x2, y2].</p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>attributes</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>JSON</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>None</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Additional attributes from Florence-2, such as color or pose.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-VideoSummary"><str=
ong>Video Summary</strong></h3>
<p><br>
This collection provides a holistic, summary view of an entire video file. =
It allows for efficient searching and categorization of videos without need=
ing to process their individual frames.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b9=
72f4bd-272b-409b-b7f0-0bff841422db" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
