<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>processing_completed</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Int64</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unix epoch timestamp indicating when the video was fully processed.</p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>quality_metrics</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>JSON</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>None</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A JSON blob containing any relevant quality or processing metrics.</p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<h4 id=3D"AI-1036:Metasight,anObjectIntelligencePlatform-ObjectTemplates"><=
strong>Object Templates</strong></h4>
<p></p>
<p>The object template is the heart of the recognition engine. It stores th=
e "ground truth" for every specific object trained. It directly enables the=
 "few-shot learning" capability.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"f0=
e53a93-735b-4a4f-a51b-108ad1dc1558" class=3D"confluenceTable">
